steps.append({"type": "card", "text": "**Core skills used, not re-taught.** *Deflection* (30.Ba3): after the queen takes the bishop, only the king defends the knight on f6. *Decoy* (31.Nh5+): the pawn takes the knight and the g-file opens for the queen. *Removing the defender*: Qxf6+ then takes the weakened knight. Where was it decided? At depth 16 the engine already rated the position before 26.Re6 at least two pawns better: the finish cashed in an earlier gain."})
